ReShiki distributes a modified zune-jpeg 0.5.15.
Original source: https://github.com/etemesi254/zune-image
Source commit: 31d81fed7551c8ccea456d9d8e2b1fd8bebb6995

ReShiki changes (2026): chroma sampling at component edges and integer IDCT
precision. These follow libjpeg-turbo 3.1.4.1 jdsample.c and jidctint.c.
The original entropy decoder, color conversion and CPU dispatch are retained.
See RESHIKI-PATCH.md in the source distribution for the patch details.

